OL,3,GNEWSABoy admits starting fire that     
OL,4,Akilled elderly couple                  
OL,6,FThe court heard he had gone for a walk 
OL,7,Fduring the night and moved the bin to  
OL,8,Fan alley alongside the house "as a     
OL,9,Fjoke" before throwing a cigarette into 
OL,10,Fit, which ignited the contents.        
